          "text": "Yobu piŵapikene yeleyi, ŵapapwile yakuwala yakwe, soni ŵamyosile mu mtwe mwakwe ligongo lya canasa cekulungwa ciŵakwete. Ŵatindiŵele pasi, nipo ŵamlambile Mlungu. ",
